      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "唉，虽然是这样没错……\n但到头来，真的需要有炒面摊贩吗……",
      "source_fingerprint": "8dd2f52b74e0c6cb76ccbf59aa221020bc57130ec9cc42e664fa5a7d778e2288",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
