      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那还用说。既不能开什锦烧店，\n也不能卖章鱼烧。正因为是炒面，\n才能像这样有个美好的结局。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f89a34f819d3e358e35fccf50971c680c7fcf502287fa22ea10ed9a8d33b4348",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
